        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Ball Tip Solid Brass Finial, Pair, Baldwin 1090.xxx.I</b>\r\n<p>An easy screw-on installation makes this hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishes details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The Ball finial is made by Baldwin out of durable solid brass so you know it will last though years of continuous use. Available in 15 finishes.</p>\r\n<p>All Baldwin decorative finials are available in matching finishes and fit interchangeably with any of the <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=328135\"><b>Baldwin Solid Brass Hinges</b></a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hinge Finials (tips) are packaged and sold by the pair. Order 1pair per hinge.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Ball Tip Finial:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy screw-on installation</li>\r\n<li>Sold in pairs</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer 15 different finishes for this Finial Tip but no matter which finish you choose, it will still be constructed out of high quality solid brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold in pairs</b>\r\n</p>",
